Q: Image change on mouse hover on particular part of image A: <p>You can use the image map.
For example :</p>

<pre><code>&lt;img src="path/to/picture.gif" width="374" height="162" usemap="#map1" id="image" /&gt;
&lt;map name="panneaux"&gt;
    &lt;area shape="rect" coords="92,19,261,66" onmouseover="action1()" alt="john" /&gt;
&lt;/map&gt;
</code></pre>

<p>Et le js :</p>

<pre><code>action1() {
    document.getElementbyId("image").src = "new image";
}
</code></pre>
